## Problem

Salesforce debug logs are noisy and hard to interpret quickly. Teams lose time manually reading raw text to identify root causes, governor limit patterns, and performance issues.

## Product Vision

LogLens turns one or many Salesforce debug logs into actionable visual insights and searchable, formatted log views with strict no-retention handling of raw log content.

## Target Users

- Individual Salesforce developers and admins
- Salesforce consulting teams and delivery orgs
- Enterprise platform operations and support teams

## Core Value Propositions

- Upload 1..N logs and get parsed insights in minutes
- Interactive graphs for timelines, hotspots, and limits behavior
- Readable formatted log view with filters and search
- Secure, org-separated SaaS model with role-based access
- Optional strict zero-retention mode for sensitive environments

## Product Principles

- Privacy first: do not persist raw logs by default
- Fast feedback: visible progress and quick parse turnaround
- Explainability: every chart can be traced to parsed events
- Multi-tenant safety: strict org-level data isolation
- Incremental complexity: ship core value before advanced features

## v1 Scope

- Upload single or batch logs
- Parse to normalized event model
- Display core charts and formatted log text
- Support individual and organization licensing
- Org roles: owner/admin/member/viewer

## Non-Goals (v1)

- Long-term archival of raw logs
- Full SIEM replacement
- Custom plugin system for user-defined parsers

## Success Metrics

- Time-to-first-insight under 2 minutes for typical logs
- 95th percentile parse completion under target size limits
- Zero confirmed incidents of cross-org data access
- High activation: upload -> chart view conversion above target